# Go
/vendor/

# Pinned ai-workflows checkout, created inside the worktree by every
# reusable workflow's "Checkout ai-workflows (pinned)" step
# (.github/workflows/{pr-review,ai-comment,issue-opened}.yml). The nested
# checkout carries its own .git; without this ignore (and the matching
# .git/info/exclude write in each reusable workflow), opencode's end-of-run
# `git add -A` would sweep it into the index as a gitlink and break the
# next `actions/checkout` with `fatal: No url found for submodule path
# '.ai-workflows' in .gitmodules`. See issue #17 Bug B.
/.ai-workflows/
